        {
            "heading": "Want to help improve the wiki?",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Anyone can contribute to the wiki. If you want to become a contributor please register and check out the work needed page . If you spot anything in need of improvement, don't hesitate to make an edit. If you plan on making any major changes it is recommended you read the style guidelines first."
